function
______

--> return
--> return complete result
--> function will end after the return the value
--> more memory usage
--> this function never resume

generator
_______

--> yield
--> return one value every yield
--> pauses after every yield
--> less memory usage
--> resume after next()

yield keyword
-----------
-->this will produces the value
-->but the yield pauses the function
-->and yield will save the functions current state
-->yield will continues where it stoped...

next() keyword
--------------
-->the next() function is used to retrieve the next value from a generator
eg:-
def how(so):
    for i in range(so):
        yield i*i
any_=how(5)
print(next(any_))
print(next(any_))
print(next(any_))
print(next(any_))
print(next(any_))

